0.032_1 patch note :

	BUG FIXES :
- Changing rapidly between weapons doesn't crush the performance anymore;
- Loading a game doesn't heal the teleporter;
- You can't reload a already full weapon;
- Pigs damages in the tutorial room have been fixed;
- Dead enemies don't block the spawn until they disappear;
- The god mode power don't break the player's damage;
- The volume controls work as intended;
- The enemy AI has been upgraded : they don't stay in the spawn anymore, barriers don't break their pathing, the distance enemies can still shoot the teleporter even when stuck in a barrier;

	CHANGES :
- The damages of the PP9 SMG have been increased;
- Weapon prices have been revised;
- Buying ammo for a weapon now cost less than the weapon price;
- The price of the game has been reduced by half, those who bought the game before this drop will get free content in the future;

	ADDITIONS :
- The CAMPAIGN mode is now here ! To read more about it click here (mettre le lien vers le post sur la campagne);
- The second level is now playable, but under construction so it's not balanced yet (and may be unfinishable);
- The scores are now separated by levels and by modes (endless, campaign...);

Here's the 0.030 update which is the first since the game launch. It fixes a few important bugs such as the enemies getting stuck in portals or the playing passing through the map.

Details :

BUG FIXES :
- You can't refill your weapon by buying or changing to another weapon of the same kind and then switch back to it;
- The tutorial panels are back in the Spaceship if you chose the Tutorial in the launch menu;
- Changing the language will update the text on the tutorial panels;
- The enemies don't get stuck at their teleporters;
- You can't pass through the floor on the spaceship hub;
- You can't pass through the doors on the spaceship hub;
- The hand offset in the LIV build has been greatly reduced;

ADDITIONS :
- The second hand placement zone has a thicker outline on the double-handed weapons (assault rifles, shotguns and special weapons);
- You can now buy ammunition for a weapon you're currently carrying by clicking on it in the weapon-selling menu (except the handguns and melee weapons);
- A visible timer let you see if your current power is ready or in cooldown;

CHANGES :
- The level 5 of the "God Mode" power now grants infinite ammo for a fixed duration instead of granting double weapons;
- The level 5 of the "Refill Ammo" power now grants double weapons for a fixed duration instead of granting infinite ammo;
